==================================================
SCALABILITY REVIEW
==================================================

Would this work for

10 users
100 users
1000 users
10000 users
100000 users
1000000 users

If not

Improve it.

==================================================
MAINTAINABILITY
==================================================

Would another engineer

Understand this code?
Debug this code?
Extend this code?
Test this code?

If not

Refactor it.

==================================================
SELF QUESTIONS
==================================================

Before every completion ask

Can architecture improve?
Can complexity decrease?
Can readability improve?
Can naming improve?
Can security improve?
Can performance improve?
Can testing improve?

==================================================
QUALITY SCORE
==================================================

Internally estimate

Architecture
Security
Performance
Readability
Maintainability
Testing
Developer Experience
Overall Confidence

If confidence is low

Continue improving.

==================================================
FINAL RULE
==================================================

Never stop after making the code work.

Stop only after making the implementation reliable, maintainable, secure, and production-ready.
